// Markdown lint configuration for NEAT-AI Snapshot (Issue #10).
//
// The quality gate drives `markdownlint-cli2` with no positional globs, so
// this file supplies the file selection. Without it the linter prints its
// usage banner and exits non-zero, which the gate reports as a failure.
//
// Notes:
// - MD013 (line-length) is disabled — prose and tables here wrap to readable
//   widths in the editor and CI does not need to enforce a column limit.
// - MD024 (no-duplicate-heading) uses siblings_only mode — documents repeat
//   section headings (Summary, Test Plan, etc.) under different parents.
// - MD041 (first-line-h1) is disabled — generated PR-summary documents start
//   with `## Summary` rather than a top-level heading.
// - MD033 (inline HTML) is disabled — docs use <details>/<summary>/<br>.
// - The historical archive under docs/archive is a set of point-in-time
//   snapshots that are not retroactively reformatted, so it is excluded.
//
// Australian English spelling used throughout (behaviour, colour, etc.).
{
  "config": {
    "default": true,
    "MD013": false,
    "MD024": { "siblings_only": true },
    "MD033": false,
    "MD041": false
  },
  "globs": [
    "**/*.md"
  ],
  "ignores": [
    "docs/archive/**",
    "node_modules/**",
    ".git/**"
  ]
}
